We define the \textit{Conditional Correction Ratio} (CCR) to summarize verifier--generator complementarity:
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:cil}
\text{CCR}(V, G) = \log \frac{P(V \text{ correct} \mid G \text{ wrong})}{P(V \text{ correct} \mid G \text{ correct})}.
